1
00:00:00,395 --> 00:00:02,015
Hi! I'm Aoi.

2
00:00:02,055 --> 00:00:03,370
And this whole video came out

3
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:05,395
of one folder on Nick's computer.

4
00:00:05,435 --> 00:00:08,100
My voice, my face, every screen you see.

5
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:08,920
All of it.

6
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,330
Want to see how it works?

7
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:12,115
Let's open the folder.

8
00:00:12,155 --> 00:00:15,105
Up top, there's a file called CLAUDE.md.

9
00:00:15,145 --> 00:00:16,225
That's the map.

10
00:00:16,265 --> 00:00:18,455
It tells any AI what lives where.

11
00:00:18,495 --> 00:00:20,240
Then there's the CONTEXT.md file.

12
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:22,555
It's the whole pipeline in one table.

13
00:00:22,595 --> 00:00:23,400
Five stages,

14
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:25,660
one command for each, the file it makes,

15
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,450
and who checks it.

16
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:28,800
First, the voice.

17
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:30,645
Then every word gets timed.

18
00:00:30,685 --> 00:00:33,300
Then a storyboard gets timed to those words.

19
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:34,790
Then comes the animation.

20
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:36,455
And last, the render.

21
00:00:36,495 --> 00:00:37,840
And between every stage,

22
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:40,795
Nick checks the file before the next one runs.

23
00:00:40,835 --> 00:00:41,970
That's the whole trick.

24
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:44,655
Take anything you do over and over.

25
00:00:44,695 --> 00:00:46,135
Make each step a folder,

26
00:00:46,175 --> 00:00:47,930
give each folder a short file,

27
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:49,980
and let the AI walk through them.

28
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,370
See you in the next one!
